ainst the section 25 criteria, set out the information that suspicion rests on, and — for information gathered in their own assessment — distinguish what came from the person themselves from what came from someone else or the medical record.","reviewStatus":"drafted"},{"section":"42","title":"Providing information contained in referral to person referred","summary":"The practitioner must give the referred person the referral information required by s 41(a) and (b), and the s 41(c) grounds, in the approved form. The exception is any part of those grounds supplied by someone else on condition that it not be passed on to the person.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"availability":"downloadable","officialPdfUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM1A_attachment_MHA2014__public.pdf","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","localPdfPath":"/forms-pdf/form-1a-attachment.pdf","localPdfSha256":"9856d48ae70fab96b03f36a987febdab6d7faa0e5ea9f62515383bc1fd62b378","localPdfBytes":163814,"officialPdfPasswordProtected":true,"officialPdfEditingRestricted":true,"officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}},"form:form-1b":{"slug":"form-1b","title":"Variation of referral","subtitle":"Use to vary referral details or extend a referral where the non-metropolitan pathway applies.","statusChips":[{"label":"medium risk","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Referral and detention","tone":"info"},{"label":"Official PDF","tone":"success"}],"primaryContact":{"label":"Form code","value":"Form 1B","detail":"Official PDF","kind":"text"},"contacts":[{"label":"Official public PDF","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM1B_MHA2014__public.pdf","detail":"Current OCP source","kind":"web"},{"label":"Official forms register","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act