ut it is currently unavailable. Check the register and local governance before proceeding.","maker":"Only an appropriately authorised person under the Mental Health Act 2014 and the approved form instructions.","involved":"Confirm the required recipients, support persons, records and local PSOLIS workflow on the current approved form.","threshold":"Confirm the statutory criteria and completion instructions on the current approved form before use.","clock":"Confirm any time limit, expiry or review point on the current approved form and local policy.","destination":"Confirm any required place or destination on the approved form.","authorises":"Only the action or record expressly described by Form 4D and the Mental Health Act 2014.","doesNotAuthorise":"No action beyond the current Act, approved form wording and the maker’s lawful authority.","before":[],"parallel":[],"after":[],"copies":"Confirm notices, copies, handover and filing requirements on the approved form.","documentationStem":"","traps":[],"safetyPearl":"Open the current official source and confirm authority, timing, notices and filing requirements before completion.","sourceNote":"Official title and availability checked against the Office of the Chief Psychiatrist register.","aliases":[],"searchTerms":[],"riskLevel":"medium","indexedTerms":[],"legalNote":"Use only the current approved form or PSOLIS pathway. This catalogue is a reference aid, not legal advice, and does not replace the Act, form instructions or local governance.","practicePearls":["Treat the approved form and current legislation as authoritative."],"preUseChecks":["Open the current official form or PSOLIS workflow before use.","Confirm the maker is appropriately authorised and all statutory criteria are met.","Confirm identifiers, date, time, signatures, notices, copies and filing requirements."],"actSections":[{"section":"555","title":"Transfer from hospital to interstate mental health service","summary":"The person in charge of a hospital may, with the Chief Psychiatrist's written approval, make a transfer order authorising a State inpatient's transfer to the interstate mental health service named in it — including an inpatient who is absent without leave as described in s 551(2). The order is in the approved form and must include the inpatient's name, the hospital transferred from and the interstate service transferred to, the time made, the reasons and the maker's details. Both the approval and the order must be filed with a copy of each to the inpatient, and a copy of each transmitted to the person in charge of the interstate service. Making it is a Part 9 notifiable event.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"availability":"unavailable","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}},"form:form-4e":{"slug":"form-4e","title":"Approval of interstate transfer order","subtitle":"The official register lists this form, but it is currently unavailable. Check the register and local governance before proceeding.","statusChips":[{"label":"medium risk","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Transport and transfer","tone":"info"},{"label":"Currently unavailable","tone":"warning"}],"primaryContact":{"label":"Form code","value":"Form 4E","detail":"Currently unavailable","kind":"text"},"contacts":[{"label":"Official forms register","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","detail":"Check current availability","kind":"web"}],"route":"Confirm the current approved form pathway and local policy.","eligibility":"Confirm the statutory criteria and completion instructions on the current approved form before use.","cost":"Official WA Mental Health Act 2014 form","referral":"Open the current official form or PSOLIS workflow before use.","location":"Western Australia","summaryCards":[{"id":"clock","label":"Clo