 days, 3 months, 7 days. Record the start time, expiry or review point, and next owner.","Source cue: sections 122, 135, 137."],"preUseChecks":["Before use: confirm conditions, supervising psychiatrist/service, review date, notices and breach response pathway.","Confirm the patient/person identifiers, maker, date, time, place and signature fields are complete.","Confirm copies, notices, support-person communication and filing/PSOLIS requirements before handover.","Open the official PDF when the form wording or authority boundary matters."],"actSections":[{"section":"122","title":"Varying order","summary":"The supervising psychiatrist may at any time while a community treatment order is in force vary its terms in any way consistent with s 115 that they consider appropriate. The variation is in the approved form with the time made, the variation itself, the reasons and the psychiatrist's details, and is filed with a copy to the patient.","reviewStatus":"drafted"},{"section":"135","title":"Change of supervising psychiatrist","summary":"The supervising psychiatrist under a community treatment order may, by arrangement, transfer that responsibility to another psychiatrist, and must then inform the patient in writing. The Chief Psychiatrist, or a person authorised in writing by them, may also transfer the responsibility by arrangement and must likewise inform the patient in writing. An authorisation may cover all or any patients treated by a specified mental health service or residing in a specified area, and has effect for the period it specifies.","reviewStatus":"drafted"},{"section":"137","title":"Change of treating practitioner","summary":"The supervising psychiatrist under a community treatment order may, by arrangement, transfer the treating practitioner's responsibility to another practitioner, and must then inform the involuntary community patient in writing of the transfer.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"sourceFacts":{"documentTitle":"Variation Of Terms Of Community Treatment Order","fileName":"📋 Form 5C.pdf","pages":2,"timings":["within 7 days","3 months","7 days"],"sectionCue":"sections 122, 135, 137","indexedAt":"Official form PDF indexed locally"},"availability":"downloadable","officialPdfUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM5C_MHA2014__public.pdf","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","localPdfPath":"/forms-pdf/form-5c.pdf","localPdfSha256":"2be5355bdc3445d49444f671d3ae6e8611e3b15e6a0dea0b70dadb24d0898957","localPdfBytes":186264,"officialPdfPasswordProtected":true,"officialPdfEditingRestricted":true,"officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}},"form:form-5d":{"slug":"form-5d","title":"Request made by a supervising psychiatrist for a practitioner to conduct the monthly examination of a patient","subtitle":"Official form source: Request For Practitioner To Conduct Monthly Examination Of A Patient. Review the source snippets and approved form before use.","statusChips":[{"label":"medium risk","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Community treatment orders","tone":"info"},{"label":"Official PDF","tone":"success"}],"primaryContact":{"label":"Form code","value":"Form 5D","detail":"Official PDF","kind":"text"},"contacts":[{"label":"Official public PDF","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM5D_MHA2014__public.pdf","detail":"Current OCP source","kind":"web"},{"label":"Official forms register","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","detail":"Check current availability","kind":"web"}],"route":"Confirm the current approved form pathway and local policy.","eligibility":"Use the threshold stated in the official form and any linked guidance.","cost":"Official WA Mental Health Act 2014 form","referral":"Before use: confirm conditions, supervising psychiatrist/service,