 community patient breaches a community treatment order the supervising psychiatrist must record the breach, give the patient notice of it, and notify the Mental Impairment Review Tribunal for a supervised person. The record of breach is in the approved form and must set out the non-compliance, the steps taken to obtain compliance, a statement of the s 126(c) belief, and the facts and reasons behind it. The notice of breach must set out the non-compliance, what the patient must do to comply, and a statement that continued non-compliance may result in being required to attend a place for treatment. Both must be filed as soon as practicable.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"sourceFacts":{"documentTitle":"Notice And Record Of Breach Of Community Treatment Order","fileName":"📋 Form 5E.pdf","pages":2,"timings":["Check timing","expiry and review requirements in the source."],"sectionCue":"sections 127","indexedAt":"Official form PDF indexed locally"},"availability":"downloadable","officialPdfUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM5E_MHA2014__public.pdf","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","localPdfPath":"/forms-pdf/form-5e.pdf","localPdfSha256":"b97d01b99d6eefe345c8a051665c047eb001a13db6cfa0626933d336d201604e","localPdfBytes":161981,"officialPdfPasswordProtected":true,"officialPdfEditingRestricted":true,"officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}},"form:form-5f":{"slug":"form-5f","title":"Order to attend","subtitle":"Official form source: Order To Attend. Review the source snippets and approved form before use.","statusChips":[{"label":"medium risk","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Community treatment orders","tone":"info"},{"label":"Official PDF","tone":"success"}],"primaryContact":{"label":"Form code","value":"Form 5F","detail":"Official PDF","kind":"text"},"contacts":[{"label":"Official public PDF","value":"h