 place. It is in the approved form with the time made, the reasons, the time and place to attend, the warning and the psychiatrist's details, and is filed with a copy to the patient.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"sourceFacts":{"documentTitle":"Order To Attend","fileName":"📋 Form 5F.pdf","pages":2,"timings":["Check timing","expiry and review requirements in the source."],"sectionCue":"sections 128","indexedAt":"Official form PDF indexed locally"},"availability":"downloadable","officialPdfUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM5F_MHA2014__public.pdf","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","localPdfPath":"/forms-pdf/form-5f.pdf","localPdfSha256":"e6acb4384559988ec06063dc6f7b6873d8f3d95df811c12c153c409ceae061e0","localPdfBytes":300775,"officialPdfPasswordProtected":true,"officialPdfEditingRestricted":true,"officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}},"form:form-6a":{"slug":"form-6a","title":"Inpatient treatment order in authorised hospital","subtitle":"Use where inpatient compulsory treatment in an authorised hospital is required.","statusChips":[{"label":"medium risk","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Inpatient treatment orders","tone":"info"},{"label":"Official PDF","tone":"success"}],"primaryContact":{"label":"Form code","value":"Form 6A","detail":"Official PDF","kind":"text"},"contacts":[{"label":"Official public PDF","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM6A_MHA2014__public.pdf","detail":"Current OCP source","kind":"web"},{"label":"Official forms register","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","detail":"Check current availability","kind":"web"}],"route":"Before: 1A | Parallel: 7A | After: Continuation, leave, revocation, CTO","eligibility":"Inpatient treatment order criteria met and less restrictiv