hiatrist must make one of three orders on the section 25 criteria: a continuation order extending the inpatient treatment order for a further detention period; a community treatment order, if an involuntary treatment order is still needed but not as an inpatient; or an order revoking the inpatient treatment order. A further detention period cannot exceed 3 months for an adult or 28 days for a child. The order is in the approved form and is filed with a copy to the inpatient; a release under (2)(b) or (c) is a Part 9 notifiable event.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"sourceFacts":{"documentTitle":"Continuation Of Inpatient Treatment Order","fileName":"📋 Form 6C.pdf","pages":2,"timings":["Up to 3 months","28 days","within 7 days","7 days","3 months"],"sectionCue":"sections 89","indexedAt":"Official form PDF indexed locally"},"availability":"downloadable","officialPdfUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM6C_MHA2014__public.pdf","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","localPdfPath":"/forms-pdf/form-6c.pdf","localPdfSha256":"60ac7150688612f935f85f1598d2fa7b1aa694331fe88df5119c7fb90147989e","localPdfBytes":178281,"officialPdfPasswordProtected":true,"officialPdfEditingRestricted":true,"officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}},"form:form-6d":{"slug":"form-6d","title":"Confirmation of inpatient treatment order","subtitle":"Official form source: Confirmation Of Inpatient Treatment Order. Review the source snippets and approved form before use.","statusChips":[{"label":"high risk","tone":"danger"},{"label":"Inpatient treatment orders","tone":"info"},{"label":"Official PDF","tone":"success"}],"primaryContact":{"label":"Form code","value":"Form 6D","detail":"Official PDF","kind":"text"},"contacts":[{"label":"Official public PDF","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM6D_MH