","confirmation of inpatient treatment order","inpatient treatment order","treatment","inpatient","hospital","authorised","involuntary","where","patient","confirmed","within 24 hours","within 24 hour"],"catchments":["Western Australia"],"catalogueLabel":"Form 6D","navigatorQuery":"Form 6D Confirmation of inpatient treatment order Inpatient treatment orders Official form source: Confirmation Of Inpatient Treatment Order. Review the source snippets and approved form before use.","source":{"label":"Office of the Chief Psychiatrist WA — approved MHA 2014 forms","status":"Source checked","url":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM6D_MHA2014__public.pdf","reviewed":"Official register checked 17 July 2026","notes":["Open the official source to confirm the current approved version before use","PSOLIS is the preferred completion method where available"]},"catalogPayload":{"id":"form-6d","form":"6D","name":"Confirmation of inpatient treatment order","category":"Inpatient treatment orders","purpose":"Official form source: Confirmation Of Inpatient Treatment Order. Review the source snippets and approved form before use.","maker":"Check the official form signature block and Act sections.","involved":"Confirm patient, maker, receiving service, support contacts and required notifications from the form.","threshold":"Use the threshold stated in the official form and any linked guidance.","clock":"within 24 hours, within 24 hour","destination":"Confirm destination/place fields on the approved form.","authorises":"Authority is limited to what the approved form and Act section state.","doesNotAuthorise":"Does not replace linked forms, consent, notification or reporting duties unless the source says so.","before":[],"parallel":[],"after":[],"copies":"Follow the approved distribution and filing fields on the form.","documentationStem":"Source-backed note for Form 6D: document maker, section, threshold facts, clock, destination/place, notifications and