ry criteria are met.","Confirm identifiers, date, time, signatures, notices, copies and filing requirements."],"actSections":[{"section":"110","title":"Cancelling leave","summary":"Where a psychiatrist forms the reasonable belief that it is inappropriate for an involuntary inpatient to remain away from hospital on leave of absence, the psychiatrist may order the leave cancelled. The order is in the approved form with the time made, the reasons for that belief and the psychiatrist's details. The psychiatrist must, as soon as practicable, tell the patient orally that the leave has been cancelled, and file the order with a copy to the inpatient. Making it is a Part 9 notifiable event.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"availability":"downloadable","officialPdfUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM7C_MHA2014__public.pdf","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","localPdfPath":"/forms-pdf/form-7c.pdf","localPdfSha256":"628b16959d43c5f4132a22734b150efe7201ad2c2778d85165eec6a065b1704d","localPdfBytes":199088,"officialPdfPasswordProtected":true,"officialPdfEditingRestricted":true,"officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}},"form:form-7d":{"slug":"form-7d","title":"Apprehension and return order","subtitle":"Official form source: Apprehension And Return Order. Review the source snippets and approved form before use.","statusChips":[{"label":"medium risk","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Leave and absence without leave","tone":"info"},{"label":"Official PDF","tone":"success"}],"primaryContact":{"label":"Form code","value":"Form 7D","detail":"Official PDF","kind":"text"},"contacts":[{"label":"Official public PDF","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM7D_MHA2014__public.pdf","detail":"Current OCP source","kind":"web"},{"label":"Official forms register","value":"https://www.chiefpsyc