 Impairment Review Tribunal. The report is in the approved form and must include the patient's name, the name and qualifications of the practitioner who provided the treatment, the names of anyone else involved, the date, time and place, the particulars of the circumstances, and the particulars of the treatment. Providing the treatment is a Part 9 notifiable event.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"sourceFacts":{"documentTitle":"Report To Chief Psychiatrist About Provision Of Urgent Non-Psychiatric Treatment","fileName":"📋 Form 9B.pdf","pages":2,"timings":["Check timing","expiry and review requirements in the source."],"sectionCue":"sections 242","indexedAt":"Official form PDF indexed locally"},"availability":"downloadable","officialPdfUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM9B_MHA2014__public.pdf","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","localPdfPath":"/forms-pdf/form-9b.pdf","localPdfSha256":"88935cf3f191ab52aad001b1c4755e56405418df798dbf576cc3f2b215244908","localPdfBytes":281085,"officialPdfPasswordProtected":true,"officialPdfEditingRestricted":true,"officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}},"form:form-10a":{"slug":"form-10a","title":"Record of oral authorisation of bodily restraint","subtitle":"Use for bodily restraint episode documentation and authorisation pathway.","statusChips":[{"label":"high risk","tone":"danger"},{"label":"Restraint","tone":"info"},{"label":"Official PDF","tone":"success"}],"primaryContact":{"label":"Form code","value":"Form 10A","detail":"Official PDF","kind":"text"},"contacts":[{"label":"Official public PDF","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM10A_MHA2014__public.pdf","detail":"Current OCP source","kind":"web"},{"label":"Official forms register","value":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-heal