orm or PSOLIS workflow before use.","location":"Western Australia","summaryCards":[{"id":"clock","label":"Clock / review","title":"Confirm any time limit, expiry or review point on the current approved form and local policy."},{"id":"authority","label":"Made by / authority","title":"Only an appropriately authorised person under the Mental Health Act 2014 and the approved form instructions.","detail":"Only the action or record expressly described by Form 13 and the Mental Health Act 2014."},{"id":"criteria","label":"Criteria / threshold","title":"Confirm the statutory criteria and completion instructions on the current approved form before use.","detail":"No action beyond the current Act, approved form wording and the maker’s lawful authority."},{"id":"act-sections","label":"Act sections","title":"Authority under the Act","detail":"201"}],"referralInfo":[{"label":"Purpose","value":"The official register lists this form, but it must be obtained from the OCP. Check the register and local governance before proceeding."},{"label":"Authorises","value":"Only the action or record expressly described by Form 13 and the Mental Health Act 2014."},{"label":"Does not authorise","value":"No action beyond the current Act, approved form wording and the maker’s lawful authority."},{"label":"Copies and filing","value":"Confirm notices, copies, handover and filing requirements on the approved form."},{"label":"Safety pearl","value":"Open the current official source and confirm authority, timing, notices and filing requirements before completion."},{"label":"Pre-use checks","value":"Open the current official form or PSOLIS workflow before use. Confirm the maker is appropriately authorised and all statutory criteria are met. Confirm identifiers, date, time, signatures, notices, copies and filing requirements."}],"bestUse":"Use only the current approved form or PSOLIS pathway. This catalogue is a reference aid, not legal advice, and does not replace the Act, form instructions or local go