athway","status":"emergent","subtitle":"Interpersonal crisis, attachment threat, shame, emptiness","clinicalHinge":"Sustained wish to die or escape, often with cognitive constriction and pessimism.","safetySnapshot":{"summary":"Escalating lethality, changed method, intoxication, dissociation.","tags":["Escalating lethality","changed method","intoxication","dissociation."]},"sections":[{"id":"why-it-fits","title":"Why it fits","summary":"Interpersonal crisis, attachment threat, shame, emptiness","items":["Interpersonal crisis, attachment threat, shame, emptiness","Sustained wish to die or escape, often with cognitive constriction and pessimism."],"tone":"fit"},{"id":"must-not-miss","title":"Must-not-miss","summary":"Escalating lethality, changed method, intoxication, dissociation.","items":["Escalating lethality","changed method","intoxication","dissociation."],"tone":"warning"},{"id":"bedside-question","title":"Bedside question","summary":"Sustained wish to die or escape, often with cognitive constriction and pessimism.","items":["Sustained wish to die or escape, often with cognitive constriction and pessimism."],"tone":"question"},{"id":"immediate-action","title":"Immediate action","summary":"Quiet, organised suicidality is often higher risk than dramatic expression Mixed states are easy to miss and carry very high suicide risk Ask about content, controllability, and compliance, not just presence of voices Do not dismiss recurrent self-harm as low risk Focus on intent, lethality, acute change, dissociation, substance use Dissociated acts can be impulsive yet highly dangerous","items":["Quiet, organised suicidality is often higher risk than dramatic expression","Mixed states are easy to miss and carry very high suicide risk","Ask about content, controllability, and compliance, not just presence of voices","Do not dismiss recurrent self-harm as low risk","Focus on intent, lethality, acute change, dissociation, substance use","Dissociated acts can be impulsive yet hig