nations delusional guilt persecutory fear sustained wish to die or escape often with cognitive constriction and pessimism. must-not-miss malevolent commands high conviction prior obedience. malevolent commands high conviction prior obedience. bedside question sustained wish to die or escape often with cognitive constriction and pessimism. sustained wish to die or escape often with cognitive constriction and pessimism. immediate action quiet organised suicidality is often higher risk than dramatic expression mixed states are easy to miss and carry very high suicide risk ask about content controllability and compliance not just presence of voices do not dismiss recurrent self-harm as low risk focus on intent lethality acute change dissociation substance use dissociated acts can be impulsive yet highly dangerous quiet organised suicidality is often higher risk than dramatic expression mixed states are easy to miss and carry very high suicide risk ask about content controllability and compliance not just presence of voices do not dismiss recurrent self-harm as low risk focus on intent lethality acute change dissociation substance use dissociated acts can be impulsive yet highly dangerous investigations mimics / overlap major depressive disorder hopelessness anhedonia guilt burdensomeness bipolar depression depression with agitation irritability racing thoughts borderline personality pathway interpersonal crisis attachment threat shame emptiness ptsd trauma cues flashbacks dissociative states substance-related suicidality intoxication withdrawal or crash states adjustment crisis acute stressor often without full syndromal illness suicidal ideation / suicide attempt / self-harm major depressive disorder bipolar depression / mixed state quiet organised suicidality is often higher risk than dramatic expression mixed states are easy to miss and carry very high suicide risk ask about content controllability and compliance not just presence of voices do not dismiss recurrent s