":"psychosis-driven-suicidality","title":"Psychosis-driven suicidality","status":"emergent","subtitle":"Command hallucinations, delusional guilt, persecutory fear","clinicalHinge":"Sustained wish to die or escape, often with cognitive constriction and pessimism.","safetySnapshot":{"summary":"Malevolent commands, high conviction, prior obedience.","tags":["Malevolent commands","high conviction","prior obedience."]},"sections":[{"id":"why-it-fits","title":"Why it fits","summary":"Command hallucinations, delusional guilt, persecutory fear","items":["Command hallucinations, delusional guilt, persecutory fear","Sustained wish to die or escape, often with cognitive constriction and pessimism."],"tone":"fit"},{"id":"must-not-miss","title":"Must-not-miss","summary":"Malevolent commands, high conviction, prior obedience.","items":["Malevolent commands","high conviction","prior obedience."],"tone":"warning"},{"id":"bedside-question","title":"Bedside question","summary":"Sustained wish to die or escape, often with cognitive constriction and pessimism.","items":["Sustained wish to die or escape, often with cognitive constriction and pessimism."],"tone":"question"},{"id":"immediate-action","title":"Immediate action","summary":"Quiet, organised suicidality is often higher risk than dramatic expression Mixed states are easy to miss and carry very high suicide risk Ask about content, controllability, and compliance, not just presence of voices Do not dismiss recurrent self-harm as low risk Focus on intent, lethality, acute change, dissociation, substance use Dissociated acts can be impulsive yet highly dangerous","items":["Quiet, organised suicidality is often higher risk than dramatic expression","Mixed states are easy to miss and carry very high suicide risk","Ask about content, controllability, and compliance, not just presence of voices","Do not dismiss recurrent self-harm as low risk","Focus on intent, lethality, acute change, dissociation, substance use","Dissociated acts can