iple QT drugs","low K+/Mg2+"]},"sections":[{"id":"why-it-fits","title":"Why it fits","summary":"Syncope, presyncope, palpitations, dizziness, or ECG QTc prolongation","items":["Syncope, presyncope, palpitations, dizziness, or ECG QTc prolongation","Temporal association with antipsychotic initiation, dose change, or depot timing."],"tone":"fit"},{"id":"must-not-miss","title":"Must-not-miss","summary":"QTc >500 ms, torsades, sudden death risk. Risk from: multiple QT drugs, low K+/Mg2+, bradycardia, congenital predisposition, structural heart disease.","items":["QTc >500 ms","torsades","sudden death risk. Risk from: multiple QT drugs","low K+/Mg2+","bradycardia","congenital predisposition","structural heart disease."],"tone":"warning"},{"id":"bedside-question","title":"Bedside question","summary":"Temporal association with antipsychotic initiation, dose change, or depot timing.","items":["Temporal association with antipsychotic initiation, dose change, or depot timing."],"tone":"question"},{"id":"immediate-action","title":"Immediate action","summary":"Constipation with clozapine is a red flag, not a nuisance side effect Clozapine constipation and myocarditis are high-risk problems Escalate early, review bowels deliberately, maintain active surveillance during early titration Early activation is a common misread Clinical toxicity can occur even when history suggests a \"usual dose\" Check ammonia if unexplained confusion develops on valproate","items":["Constipation with clozapine is a red flag, not a nuisance side effect","Clozapine constipation and myocarditis are high-risk problems","Escalate early, review bowels deliberately, maintain active surveillance during early titration","Early activation is a common misread","Clinical toxicity can occur even when history suggests a \"usual dose\"","Check ammonia if unexplained confusion develops on valproate"],"tone":"action"},{"id":"investigations","title":"Investigations","summary":"ECG / QT assessment, Urea, electrolytes,