or reporting duties unless the source says so.","before":[],"parallel":[],"after":[],"copies":"Follow the approved distribution and filing fields on the form.","documentationStem":"Source-backed note for Form 12B: document maker, section, threshold facts, clock, destination/place, notifications and next owner.","traps":["Do not infer powers beyond the form wording.","Check linked forms, attachments, notifications and clock limits."],"safetyPearl":"Open the source snippets before relying on the pathway.","sourceNote":"Indexed from 📋 Form 12B.pdf.","aliases":["12b","record of refusal of patient's request to access document","rights and notifications"],"searchTerms":["document","information","access","request","relevant","refusal","refused","disclosure"],"riskLevel":"medium","indexedTerms":[],"legalNote":"Rights, notification and communication forms should be specific about the right affected, reason, review time, copies and advocacy/support-person communication. Use only the current approved form or PSOLIS pathway where available; only appropriately authorised people should complete MHA 2014 forms. Authority is limited to the Act sections, signature block, time limits and wording on the approved form.","practicePearls":["Open the source snippets before relying on the pathway.","For rights forms, the review time and notification trail are part of the safeguard.","Clock cue: Check timing, expiry and review requirements in the source.. Record the start time, expiry or review point, and next owner.","Source cue: sections 248."],"preUseChecks":["Before use: confirm the right or notice, reason, recipient, copy pathway, review time and support/advocacy information.","Confirm the patient/person identifiers, maker, date, time, place and signature fields are complete.","Confirm copies, notices, support-person communication and filing/PSOLIS requirements before handover.","Open the official PDF when the form wording or authority boundary matters."],"actSections":[{"section":"248","title":"Right to access medical record and other documents","summary":"Unless s 249(1)(a) or (b) or (3) applies, a person who is or was provided with treatment or care by a mental health service is entitled to inspect and be given a copy of any relevant document about them held by the person in charge or a staff member, in addition to any other right of access they have. The person in charge must ensure any such request is dealt with as soon as practicable, and that if it is refused a record of the reasons is filed in the approved form and a copy given to the person.","reviewStatus":"drafted"}],"sourceFacts":{"documentTitle":"Record Of Refusal Of Patient's Request To Access Document","fileName":"📋 Form 12B.pdf","pages":2,"timings":["Check timing","expiry and review requirements in the source."],"sectionCue":"sections 248","indexedAt":"Official form PDF indexed locally"},"availability":"downloadable","officialPdfUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/FORM12B_MHA2014__public.pdf","officialRegisterUrl":"https://www.chiefpsychiatrist.wa.gov.au/laws-and-rights/legislation/mental-health-act-2014-forms/","localPdfPath":"/forms-pdf/form-12b.pdf","localPdfSha256":"9deee79f80c652b7a4bdbc34643144d429c29520e42d971a5d78c2008bed79b0","localPdfBytes":236674,"officialPdfPasswordProtected":true,"officialTitleCheckedAt":"17 July 2026","archiveGeneratedAt":"2026-07-13T16:02:29.961824Z"}}},{"logicalId":"forms:form-12c","logicalDocumentId":"e8dbc7ef-0223-5a73-83f9-151d0fbb3c70","logicalChunkId":"baa57eb7-b92e-5332-bbdf-ca1baaec2297","normalizedText":"Form: Restriction on freedom of communication\nUse when a communication right is restricted and review/notification requirements apply.\nRoute: Parallel: Communication restriction attachment | After: Review, cease or renew pathway\nEligibility: Restriction basis and reasons are documented for the specific communication right.\nReferral: Before use: confirm the right or notice, reason, recipient, copy pat