 can be extended under s 45 where the examination will be conducted and when the s 39 1 assessment was completed. it must certify the practitioner s reasonable suspicion against the section 25 criteria set out the information that suspicion rests on and for information gathered in their own assessment distinguish what came from the person themselves from what came from someone else or the medical record. section 42 providing information contained in referral to person referred the practitioner must give the referred person the referral information required by s 41 a and b and the s 41 c grounds in the approved form. the exception is any part of those grounds supplied by someone else on condition that it not be passed on to the person. form forms checklist assessment transfer template","contentHash":"12eb9e100f95a7f6c0ccd4dfda46d8235385138c8c7ab6daf6d3ca44a6341950","publicationFingerprint":"73621edc333455e415e8e6aaabcff99426f2e7bc6acfe11c043ff2e1af37795d","governanceFingerprint":"6473895da16d5508d03ffea998bc94f9de73dd719d70d551126b969e94bd3eab","lineageFingerprint":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","publicMetadataFingerprint":"3efd71af2015bc7af25c4319ca0185171978a55d699ca3d0d6f14893116d3d0e","record":{"version":"site-content-record-v1","logicalId":"forms:form-1a-attachment","producerClass":"dynamic_registry","domain":"forms","route":"/forms/form-1a-attachment","title":"Information provided by another person in confidence","body":"Form: Information provided by another person in confidence\nUse the current approved Form 1A attachment to record information provided by another person in confidence when the statutory and local requirements are met.\nRoute: Confirm the current approved form pathway and local policy.\nEligibility: Confirm the statutory criteria and completion instructions on the current approved form before use.\nReferral: Open the current official form or PSOLIS workflow before use.\nLocation: Western Australia\nBest use: U