riation/extension required because reason . updated destination/expiry details . safety pearl variation is only useful while the underlying pathway is still lawful. common traps assuming a variation fixes an expired referral. forgetting to update destination or receiving team. pre-use checks before use confirm the assessment basis examination place referral expiry and any linked detention or transport form. confirm the patient/person identifiers maker date time place and signature fields are complete. confirm copies notices support-person communication and filing/psolis requirements before handover. open the official pdf when the form wording or authority boundary matters. before use confirm the assessment basis examination place referral expiry and any linked detention or transport form. caution confirm the patient/person identifiers maker date time place and signature fields are complete. caution confirm copies notices support-person communication and filing/psolis requirements before handover. caution assuming a variation fixes an expired referral. reject forgetting to update destination or receiving team. reject official title and availability checked 17 july 2026 archive guidance remains a prototype reference aid and requires local clinical/legal governance review use the current approved pdf or psolis form do not modify approved form content 1b referral and detention use to vary referral details or extend a referral where the non-metropolitan pathway applies. authorised maker specified by the form pathway. existing referral remains live and variation or extension criteria are met. extension must be actioned before referral expiry where applicable. variation or extension of the referral pathway as specified. a new detention or transport power by itself. extension variation rural referral non metro expired destination transport rural extension referral place practitioner examination authorised medical time date 72 hours section 45 extending referral made outside metropolitan area where a referral was made outside the metropolitan area and the person responsible for transporting the patient forms the view it will expire before arrival an extension of a further 72 hours may be obtained. the request goes to the referring practitioner or if they are unavailable another practitioner at the same place or failing that any other mp or amhp the transporting person may extend it themselves only if no practitioner is reasonably available and they are themselves an mp or amhp. the extension is recorded in the approved form with the time granted the new expiry and the reasons and filed with a copy to the person. a referral cannot be extended more than once. section 46 changing place where examination will be conducted an mp or amhp may change the place specified in a s 26 referral where the examination will be conducted but only after consulting a practitioner at the proposed new place. they must promptly tell whoever is transporting the person record the change in the approved form with the old and new places and the time and file it with a copy to the person. changing between an authorised hospital and a non-hospital place switches which limb of s 26 the referral is treated as having been made under. form forms checklist assessment transfer template","contentHash":"9a40dc8da275829ad351b05951295ae9ae843bfc14bb277e934f21bd69418db3","publicationFingerprint":"fbd58e26937ee1ea5d67471d6f3bb725895eeb5e9080dd0162e44fc4e1b0c4cd","governanceFingerprint":"6473895da16d5508d03ffea998bc94f9de73dd719d70d551126b969e94bd3eab","lineageFingerprint":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","publicMetadataFingerprint":"f146ebf2795378378d638885bb307ef7f9d7e57b0bd73d45d58f65815ccabba5","record":{"version":"site-content-record-v1","logicalId":"forms:form-1b","producerClass":"dynamic_registry","domain":"forms","route":"/forms/form-1b","title":"Variation of referral","body":"Form: Variation of referral\nUse to vary referral details o